">\n                <h2>🔄 Whitelist Updates</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor in Slack Improvements and Side Chats</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Cursor in Slack now shares a plan before starting, runs in multi-repo environments, and can work across channels and threads. Added side chats for parallel conversations, conversation search with local indexing, and redesigned project/repo pickers.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-17</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot Repository-level Usage Metrics</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Repository-level GitHub Copilot usage metrics became generally available. The GitHub Copilot app is now available in the usage metrics API.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-17</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Copilot Code Review Customization</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Improvements to Copilot code review