p/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Windsurf → Devin Desktop Rebrand</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Windsurf was rebranded to Devin Desktop. Updates include hardened migration on Windows, improved file context handling, and various bug fixes. Devin Cloud sessions now auto-reconnect when network returns.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-15</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">bugfix</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\n                        \"Windsurf is now Devin Desktop. The rebrand reflects where the product is headed: a command center for managing local and cloud agents.\"\n                        <span class=\"quote-source\">— Reddit</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Quote Text in Messages</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        You can now select text in a session from files, worklog, or Devin's messages. AI context now includes security findings.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-15</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-07-14-github-copilot-in-visual-studio-june-update/\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot in Visual Studio - June Update</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        June 2026 update focused on visibility and trust with clearer view of GitHub Copilot usage, new trust layer for MCP.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-14</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Code Scanning AI Security Detections</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Code scanning now shows AI security detections on pull requests.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-14</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Codex CLI Updates - July 2026</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Bug fixes for bundled instructions in GPT-5.6 Sol, Terra, and Luna. Restored 272,000-token context windows and refreshed bundled instructions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-14</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">bugfix</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini CLI v0.50.0 Stable Release</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Latest stable release v0.50.0. Note: Gemini CLI was shut down on June 18, 2026, and is being transitioned to Antigravity CLI.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-08</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Agentic Autofix for Code Scanning</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Agentic autofix for code scanning alerts entered public preview.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-10</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">GPT-5.6 Sol, Terra, and Luna Available in Copilot</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        OpenAI's GPT-5.6 Sol, Terra, and Luna models are now available in GitHub Copilot.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-09</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\n                        \"Copilot has improved immensely in 2026. It works about as well as Claude Code these days in my experience.\"\n                        <span class=\"quote-source\">— HN</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n                <h2>💡 Technical Insights</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://llm-stats.com/llm-updates\" target=\"_blank\">GPT-5.6, Grok 4.5, and Kimi K3 released in July 2026</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Major AI model releases in July 2026 include OpenAI's GPT-5.6 family (Sol, Terra, and Luna tiers), xAI's Grok 4.5 for coding and agent tasks, and Moonshot AI's Kimi K3.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-16</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">LLM Stats</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">model releases</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">GPT</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Grok</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Claude</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://kersai.com/ai-breakthroughs-july-2026/\" target=\"_blank\">July 2026 AI Price War: Grok 4.5, GPT-5.6, and Muse Spark 1.1 Redefine Enterprise Costs</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Massive price war in July 2026: SpaceXAI, OpenAI, and Meta shipped new flagship models within 24 hours. Grok 4.5 costs $2 per million input tokens, GPT-5.6 Luna at $1, and Muse Spark 1.1 at $1.25.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-13</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Kersai</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI pricing</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">enterprise AI</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://kersai.com/ai-breakthroughs-july-2026/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta Shifts from Open-Weight to Closed Paid Models with Muse Spark 1.1</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Meta launched Muse Spark 1.1 as their first paid closed model, ending years of dominating the open-weight AI space with the Llama series. This signals that giving away frontier models for free is no longer sustainable.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-13</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Kersai</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Meta</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open-weight</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agentic AI</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://kersai.com/ai-breakthroughs-july-2026/\" target=\"_blank\">DeepSeek Designs Custom Inference Silicon to Break Free from Nvidia and Huawei</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        On July 7, 2026, Reuters reported that DeepSeek is designing its own AI chip targeting inference to reduce reliance on Nvidia and Huawei. The AI hardware stack is bifurcating into US-aligned and China-aligned ecosystems.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-13</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Kersai</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">DeepSeek</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI chips</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Nvidia</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Ask Copilot for Repository Overview</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New feature to ask Copilot for a repository overview.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-09</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">GitHub Copilot</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Devin Desktop and CLI Updates</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added 'New session in space' to session menu, fixed diff viewing issues in autonomous mode, added /mcp slash command with live MCP server status panel, and sandbox feature.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-07</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Devin</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://windsurf.com/changelog/vscode\" target=\"_blank\">Windsurf v1.42 and Chat Improvements</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Codeium v1.42 with chat improvements, UI & visual enhancements, command improvements, and enterprise & technical updates.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-04</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Windsurf</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Copilot Vision Generally Available</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Copilot vision became generally available.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-display\">2026-07-01</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">GitHub Copilot</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\n                        \"2021-2026, Goodbye, Copilot - discussing the end of an era and billing model changes\"\n                        <span class=\"quote-source\">— Reddit</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <p>\n                <a href=\"#\">← Previous Day</a> |\n     